    "abstract": "The recently developed self-consistent vertex corrected GW method is used to calculate the 5f electronic structure in delocalized α -U and localized δ -Pu, each of which is confirmed by the historical experimental approaches of direct and inverse photoemission. Tender X-Ray Emission Spectroscopy (XES), in a novel application to 5f electronic structure, is used to experimentally prove the existence of 5f delocalization in α -U.",
